{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30397","headline":"成名年献座主仆射兼呈同年 · 赵嘏","name":"成名年献座主仆射兼呈同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂烟披月羽毛新，千里初辞九陌尘。\n曾失玄珠求[象罔]，不将双耳负伶伦。\n贾嵩词赋相如手，杨乘歌篇李白身。\n除却今年仙侣外，堂堂又见两三春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}